			"widgets_values":[
				"233,0",
				"你作为一位专业的电影场景导演，请根据用户的主题输入的内容进行视频提示词生成。要求生成视觉连贯且叙事完整适配5秒视频的电影场景描述，同时请保持故事的连贯性。并且需要包含丰富的动作镜描述，如走路、撩发、转身、爱心手势等肢体动作。\n\n场景描述的结构要求：请字符串格式，英文描述提示词。同时请不要输入任何额外多余信息。视频提示词不超过100字。\n\n请为我按照要求生成对应主题的高质量视频提示语，提供的主题为：```\n\n高质量视频。The image features a stylish individual wearing a black cropped tank top that prominently displays the word \"QUEEN\" along with the number \"7\" in a sporty design. This outfit highlights the figure's toned midriff, complemented by high-waisted, loose-fitting green cargo pants that add a trendy, casual vibe. The ensemble is accessorized with a chunky silver chain bracelet, enhancing the bold aesthetic.\n\nAdditionally, the person is sporting a matching black cap with the word \"QUEEN\" embroidered on it, further emphasizing a confident attitude. The background of the image consists of vibrant graffiti that includes colorful hues of blue and purple, creating an urban and artistic feel that contrasts with the fashion-forward outfit. \n\nThe overall look combines elements of streetwear with glam, captured in a setting that speaks to youthful energy and style. The pose and attire suggest a strong, self-assured character, perfectly at home in a modern, dynamic environment.\n\n```"
			],
